      foundation: true,
      formula: String.raw`A \times B \subseteq \mathcal P(\mathcal P(A \cup B))`,
      text: "For any sets A and B the ordered pairs (a, b) with a ∈ A and b ∈ B form a set A × B.",
      proof: "Every pair {{a}, {a, b}} is an element of 𝒫(𝒫(A ∪ B)); A × B is separated from this set.",
