      formula: String.raw`\alpha + \beta = \{q + r : q \in \alpha,\ r \in \beta\}`,
      text: "The Dedekind cuts of ℚ form a set ℝ, which with addition of cuts, the corresponding multiplication and the order by inclusion is an ordered field containing ℚ.",
