      proofName: "Union of cuts", proofYear: 1872, proofWho: "Dedekind",
      formula: String.raw`S \subseteq \mathbb R,\ S \ne \emptyset,\ S \ \text{bounded above} \;\Rightarrow\; \sup S \in \mathbb R`,
