      formula: String.raw`p \in G,\quad G \cap D_n \ne \emptyset \ \ (n \in \mathbb N)`,
      text: "For a forcing notion ℙ, countably many dense sets D<sub>0</sub>, D<sub>1</sub>, … and a condition p there is a filter G containing p that meets every D<sub>n</sub>. In particular a countable transitive model M has generic filters over it.",
